! mcp_bootstrap_p315.strap -- MCP printed page 315: DISK FETCH continued,
! the alpha-zero path (X LC ALF, C ALFZE), the read of one arc (C SET J,
! C URD), and the parity/size check (CHK PAR), lines 1-49.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.66, read at 400 dpi, doubtful glyphs
! at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD
! ID SB000170  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 315"; the heading row's
! LOCATION field is 234062, line 1's word.
!
! THE PAGE.  49 lines; every line number prints a "*" after it.  Three
! remarks (lines 30, 35, 44), no remark cards, no TAIL card.  Located
! rows run contiguous from 234062.00 (line 1) to 234115.00 (line 49,
! BZXVZ, a half word; next location 234115.40), then blank paper.  "*"
! after the LOCATION on lines 17 and 39.
!   lines 5-7  null operations ", D LOCS", ", PROSA", ", 0" -- the same
!              list p.313 lines 1-3 prints.
! JOIN.  p.313 ends at 234021.00 / SB000126; p.314 (not landed) must
! carry 234021.40 .. 234061.40 and serials SB000127 .. SB000169.  This
! page opens at SB000170, so the serials leave room for p.314 exactly;
! location contiguity with p.314 is NOT established here.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * "B, C MCP" (line 4) and ", C LOCS" (line 5): D with a worn stem.
!     The binaries 000040.10 and 000003.01 are DMCP (32.0, landed
!     p.108) and DLOCS (3.01, landed p.104).
!   * "C URD" (line 21, 39, 45) kept CURD: b8decks p.312 spells it so,
!     and nothing here closes it to D.
!   * "CNNOTO" (line 49): both O's are the drum's squared open glyph, the
!     same as the O of "C FOT" / "C NORM"; the digit 0 of "1.0" on the
!     same card is a narrower oval at 900 dpi.  Written CNNOTO.
!   * "CW RD" (line 14): the sheet read "CH RD"; the ink is W, and the
!     second half word 234416.02 is p.313's CWRD.
!   * octal / hex fields with an open round read 0 ("CO" = 00, "DO" =
!     D0, "AO" = A0, "OD" = 0D, "FO" = F0, "CO" on line 45 = C0).
!   * names spaced by the drum (X LC ALF, C ALFZE, CHK PAR, C GAMMA,
!     C DELTA, C W DISK, CW DISK, C RD BR, C READ, A DSK RD, C T,
!     C SET J, C URD, C NORM, C N PRIM, X RETN, C FOT, C BETA, C N)
!     written closed up.
!
! EXTERNALS.  Values for symbols defined on pages not landed come from
! this page's binary (each comment says how much it fixes).
!
! CARD SERIALS.  SB000170 .. SB000214.  Shared serials: lines 9-10
! (SB000178), 11-12 (SB000179), 15-16 (SB000182), 24-25 (SB000190).
! None skipped.

